# Per-trial Syne Tune experiment logs/metadata: thousands of small files per
# simulation sweep, ~410MB total, fully regeneratable by rerunning
# run_simulations.py / run_pinned_fidelity_simulations.py / etc. against the
# blackbox files (which ARE tracked). Not worth versioning.
**/syne_tune_runs/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS
.DS_Store

# SLURM job logs: regeneratable, not worth versioning
.logs/

# SLURM job logs: regeneratable, not worth versioning
.logs/

# Figures and result tables: regenerated by the analyze_*.py / run_*.py
# pipeline from the tracked blackbox (.npy/.parquet) data -- not worth
# versioning, changes on every rerun.
*.png
*.csv
*.zip